{
  "name": "CRYPTO 04 — Gas Price Monitor + Alert Cheap",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched",
      "name": "Check Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "g1",
              "name": "chains",
              "value": "=[\n  { \"name\": \"BNB Chain\", \"rpc\": \"https://bsc.publicnode.com/\", \"target_gwei\": 1 },\n  { \"name\": \"Ethereum\", \"rpc\": \"https://eth.llamarpc.com\", \"target_gwei\": 10 },\n  { \"name\": \"Base\", \"rpc\": \"https://mainnet.base.org\", \"target_gwei\": 0.1 }\n]",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfg",
      "name": "List Chain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const c of $json.chains) {\n  out.push({ json: { name: c.name, rpc: c.rpc, target: c.target_gwei } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "split",
      "name": "Split Per Chain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.rpc }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": 1, \"method\": \"eth_gasPrice\", \"params\": [] }",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "rpc",
      "name": "Fetch Gas Price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hex = $json.result || '0x0';\nconst wei = BigInt(hex);\nconst gwei = Number(wei) / 1e9;\n\nconst name = $('Split Per Chain').item.json.name;\nconst target = $('Split Per Chain').item.json.target;\n\nconst cheap = gwei <= target;\n\nlet message = '';\nif (cheap) {\n  message = '⛽ *CHEAP GAS — ' + name + '*\\n\\n';\n  message += 'Gas price: *' + gwei.toFixed(3) + ' gwei*\\n';\n  message += 'Target: ' + target + ' gwei\\n\\n';\n  message += 'Estimated swap cost (150k gas): ' + (150000 * gwei / 1e9).toFixed(8) + ' native\\n\\n';\n  message += 'Time: ' + new Date().toISOString();\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { name, gwei, target, cheap, message } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Check Cheap Gas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.cheap }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if",
      "name": "Gas Cheap?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "REPLACE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Send Gas Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRYPTO 04 — Gas Price Alert\n\n**Flow:**\nEvery 5 minutes → check the gas price on 3 chains → if below the target → send an alert\n\n**What to edit:**\n- `chains` in the *Chain List* node — add chains + target gwei\n\n**Default targets:**\n- BNB Chain: 1 gwei\n- Ethereum: 10 gwei\n- Base: 0.1 gwei\n\n**Good for:**\n- Airdrop farmers (mint when gas is cheap)\n- Traders (swap when gas is low)\n- Anyone who wants to cut transaction costs\n\n**No API key needed** — uses free public RPC.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Check Every 5 Minutes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List Chain",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List Chain": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Per Chain",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Per Chain": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Gas Price",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Gas Price": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Cheap Gas",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Cheap Gas": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gas Cheap?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gas Cheap?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Gas Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}